#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:5
#: fff472543d064c11986cd16f60afa269
msgid "Current Limiting and Voltage Scaling"
msgstr "限流与电压缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:7
#: 73b7b4a4d6eb4222a3fe84d3d810416f
msgid ""
"Copter includes *current limiting* in order to protect the battery from "
"damage and *voltage scaling* to compensate for the voltage drop as the "
"battery is depleted.  Both of these features require the vehicle to have a "
":ref:`Power Module or other voltage and current monitor <common-powermodule-"
"landingpage>`."
msgstr ""
"Copter 包含*限流*功能以保护电池免受损坏，以及*电压缩放*功能以补偿电池耗尽时的电压下降。这两项功能都需要飞行器配备 "
":ref:`电源模块或其他电压和电流监测器 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:14
#: d670eabebdc04b3893ce203773856b3c
msgid "Current limiting and voltage scaling were introduced in Copter 3.3."
msgstr "限流和电压缩放功能在 Copter 3.3 中引入。"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:18
#: 2ffdb23221a346d7bf349e20b462178d
msgid "Current Limiting"
msgstr "限流"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:20
#: 3c18105a52d14b66b0cfbfbd146dc152
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This protection automatically drops the throttle to as low as 60% of full "
"throttle in order to limit the current requested from the battery. This can "
"be useful to protect the battery from damage."
msgstr "该保护功能会自动将油门降至最大油门的 60%，以限制从电池请求的电流。这有助于保护电池免受损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:24
#: 6af2626d81374bde98d23fcfe5333526
msgid ""
"To enable the feature, set the :ref:`MOT_BAT_CURR_MAX<MOT_BAT_CURR_MAX>` "
"parameter to the desired limit in amps (or \"0\" to disable this feature)."
msgstr ""
"要启用此功能，请将 :ref:`MOT_BAT_CURR_MAX<MOT_BAT_CURR_MAX>` "
"参数设置为所需的限制值（以安培为单位），或设为\"0\"以禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:30
#: b0df792f05b14156a869711ffebb176a
msgid ""
"If the measured current exceeds this limit the maximum throttle will be "
"reduced to a safe level in 1 to 5 seconds (depending upon how far over the "
"limit it is).  Because the limit can be exceeded for short periods of time, "
"the limit should be set somewhere between the battery's burst limit and its "
"absolute upper limit."
msgstr ""
"如果测量电流超过此限制，最大油门将在 1 到 5 "
"秒内降至安全水平（取决于超出限制的程度）。由于限制可以在短时间内被超过，限制值应设置在电池的瞬时限制和绝对上限之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:38
#: cf08f0d26ede478cbb74950cc9d2fdc4
msgid "Voltage scaling"
msgstr "电压缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:40
#: bdcea00636234bd081f9f9d129de6a4c
msgid ""
"If enabled, this feature will increase the roll, pitch and yaw control gains"
" to compensate for the voltage drop as a battery is depleted.  This is "
"helpful in that it helps ensure the vehicle's attitude controls do not "
"degrade as the battery weakens."
msgstr "若启用，此功能将增加横滚、俯仰和偏航控制增益，以补偿电池耗尽时的电压下降。这有助于确保飞行器的姿态控制在电池变弱时不会退化。"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:45
#: 0d714e8fc42f4e9ba37c368a002bf6a4
msgid ""
"To enable set the :ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX<MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` to the battery's"
" full charge voltage (i.e. 12.6 for a 3S battery).  Gains will be scaled to "
"attempt to maintain the attitude control response seen at full charge."
msgstr ""
"要启用，请将 :ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX<MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` 设置为电池的满充电压（即 3S 电池为 "
"12.6V）。增益将被缩放以尝试维持满充时的姿态控制响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/current-limiting-and-voltage-scaling.rst:49
#: 49dfbdac73024b139683305dab962d85
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN<MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` to the minimum battery voltage"
" the vehicle would normally experience.  The gains will not be scaled up any"
" more as the voltage falls below this level.  Setting this to the "
":ref:`battery failsafe voltage <failsafe-battery>` is a good start."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN<MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` "
"设置为飞行器通常会经历的最低电池电压。当电压低于此水平时，增益将不再继续放大。将其设置为 :ref:`电池失控保护电压 <failsafe-"
"battery>` 是一个好的起点。"
